# Nothing to configure: this version keeps its data in files (the "data" folder), so it needs no database and no passwords.
# To add a database later, ask DevTeam: devteam run "add the database"  (see README.md).

# Who uses the app. single (the default): no sign-in, one person on this computer. multi: people sign in with their own accounts.
# With multi, the first person to register takes over whatever was made before in single mode.
# AUTH_MODE=multi
